WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.725
Volume is the base, layer on layer.

2
00:00:03.577 --> 00:00:06.427
One layer covers the base: twelve cubes.

3
00:00:07.104 --> 00:00:09.479
Each new layer adds another twelve.

4
00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:20.869
Five layers of twelve: sixty cubic centimetres.
